cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "datablinder: Synthetic Look-Alike Copies of Sensitive Data Files"
abstract: >-
  An R package that replaces the contents of a sensitive or proprietary data file
  with synthetic values while keeping the columns, classes, formats and file type
  identical, so that analysis code written against the anonymised copy runs
  unchanged on the real data. Intended for sharing the structure of a dataset
  with a collaborator or a large language model assistant without sharing its
  contents. It reduces disclosure risk and offers no formal privacy guarantee.
authors:
